# Route: guide 35 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 55 to
# 56, 78 quests, 3.2 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Thunder Bluff, Undercity, Felwood, Stonetalon Mountains, Desolace):
# Thunder Bluff -> near Thunder Bluff -> Thunder Bluff -> near Thunder Bluff
# -> Thunder Bluff -> near Thunder Bluff -> Thunder Bluff -> near Thunder
# Bluff -> Thunder Bluff -> near Thunder Bluff -> near Undercity -> Undercity
# -> near Undercity -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Star, the Hand and the Heart
# (736; Grel'borg the Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44);
# Nothing But The Truth (1383; Deepstrider Giant 38-39, Deepstrider Searcher
# 39-40); Shadowshard Fragments (7068; Shadowshard Rumbler 40-41, Shadowshard
# Smasher 41-42, Shadowshard Thunderer 38).
#
# Left out: Rites of the Earthmother (776), Preparation for Ceremony (744):
# the route takes them here but cannot finish them (the coverage report's
# missed quests).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Leaders of the Fang (914), Compendium of the Fallen
# (1049), A Vengeful Fate (1102), Testing an Enemy's Strength (5723), The Book
# of Ur (1013), The Book of Ur (1013), Going, Going, Guano! (1109), Going,
# Going, Guano! (1109), Bring the End (3341), The Power to Destroy... (5725),
# Light's Justice (92421), Light's Justice (92421), The New Plague (95216),
# Source of Power (96988), Blood of the Black Dragon Champion (6602),
# Vyletongue Corruption (7029), Legends of Maraudon (7044), Corruption of
# Earth and Seed (7064), The Pariah's Instructions (7067).

